        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cynthia Nixon, Miranda Hobbes\n- TV Series: Sex and the City\n- Awards: Primetime Emmy Award, Screen Actors Guild Award\n\nFacts:\n- Cynthia Nixon portrayed Miranda Hobbes in the HBO series Sex and the City from 1998 to 2004.\n- Cynthia Nixon is known for her portrayal of Miranda Hobbes in Sex and the City.\n- In 2004, Cynthia Nixon won the Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Supporting Actress in a Comedy Series for Sex and the City.\n- Cynthia Nixon received an Emmy Award and a Screen Actors Guild Award for her performance as Miranda Hobbes.",
